posts.body:
THANK YOU that was it!! I was able to get everything working by adding the font into the gamefont.css file.
For anyone wondering, it looks like this to add in a new font :
@font-face {
font-family: GameFont;
src: url("BubblegumSans-Regular.otf");
}
@font-face {
font-family: Roboto;
src: url("Roboto-Regular.otf");
And now it's working when I set the parameter to "Roboto"
